{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119815","id":3755066648,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7f0cUY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119815","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119815.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119815.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119815","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119815/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119815/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119815/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e62ade82569fa6b8bd379230c1c15cb0f9662583","number":119815,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Break out of Tween infinite loops in release builds","user":{"login":"suyong-kim","id":16343649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzQzNjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16343649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim","html_url":"https://github.com/suyong-kim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suyong-kim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The infinite-loop guard in `Tween::step` (the `initial_delta` / `potential_infinite` book-keeping plus the `Math::is_equal_approx(rem_delta, initial_delta)` check) is wrapped in `#ifdef DEBUG_ENABLED`. In release builds the guard is compiled out, so a Tween with `set_loops(-1)` whose tweener returns `temp_delta = 0` makes the inner `while (running && rem_delta > 0)` loop spin forever and freezes the main thread.\n\nThis moves the two guard variables out of the debug-only block. Debug builds still hit the existing `ERR_FAIL_V_MSG`; release builds break the step with `return false`. The detection logic itself is unchanged.\n\nNo associated bug report yet — happy to open a minimal repro issue (a `set_loops(-1)` tween whose tweener returns zero delta) if that helps triage. The freeze was originally diagnosed on an Android export via simpleperf.\n\nDisclosure: I used an LLM to help draft the commit message and the original PR description. The code change itself (moving the two `#ifdef` boundaries, +12 / -4) is mine.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","t